Z||000000||RobertVol||02-18-2001||12:37 AM||||A couple months back I replaced the entire EGR system. Now after starting the car and running around town....No problem<P>Get on the Interstate and set at a speed like 60-70 and stay there for awhile and it throw the check engine on. I have replaced the IAC also. I am thinking 02 Sensor needs to be replaced. Any idea or does this souns correct? I am replacing anyway since the car hit 59000 miles and it will go soon more than likely anyway. But opinions would be helpful. Thanks as always! <P>Rob <P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT 56k T TOP  <BR>North Florida Fiero Club <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=819451&a=5959473&p=36934984&Sequence=1"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||terryk||02-18-2001||01:04 AM||||We need to know the error code.<P>Jump A and B on the ALDL connector behind the cigarette lighter cover and turn on the key and count the flashes of the CE lamp.||||reg||1
