Z||000003||tgowens||02-18-2001||07:05 PM||||nope Robert, there is no way to tell without knowing what code the ECM is giving........I had a condition similar to that and it was a faulty coolant temperature sensor -- check the code so you don't bark up the wrong tree!||||reg||1
